# brutalist.art — optional capability keys.
# Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill what you want.
# No key is required for the default free tier (Kokoro, Manim, Remotion).
# A missing key means the feature falls back to the free path silently —
# nothing breaks and nothing will ever prompt you to spend money.

# ── Higgsfield — AI video beats ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Absent = Higgsfield beats fall back to Ken Burns stills automatically.
# The scripts call the `higgsfield` CLI (run `higgsfield auth login` once).
# These env vars are an optional credential alternative; the CLI login is preferred.
# Get it: https://higgsfield.ai
HIGGSFIELD_API_KEY=

# ── Smithsonian Open Access — free archival CC0 still library ────────────────
# Used by smithsonian_fetch.py and image_fetch.py (--source smithsonian).
# Get it free: https://api.data.gov/signup/  (instant; email confirm)
# Leave blank to use --s3 streaming mode (no key, slower).
SI_API_KEY=

# ── RENDER TARGET ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Where a clean 4K master lands. brutalist.art RENDERS; it never publishes.
# Any folder works — a local dir, an external drive, a Google Drive mount.
# Unset = <toolkit>/renders/ . Override per-run with:  ./art final <reel> --out DIR
ART_OUT=
